{"id":"auparavant","lemma":"auparavant","pos":"adv","rank":1952,"glosses":["beforehand, previously"],"ipa":"/o.pa.ʁa.vɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e8/Fr-auparavant.ogg/Fr-auparavant.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Avez-vous fait cela auparavant ?","en":"Have you done that before?","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"that"},null]},{"text":"Je suis jamais venu ici auparavant.","en":"I've never been here before.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/334519","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"never"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"here"},null]},{"text":"Nous sommes-nous déjà rencontrés auparavant ?","en":"Have we ever met before?","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"already, before"},null,null]},{"text":"L'as-tu essayé auparavant ?","en":"Have you tried it before?","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to test, to try on","l":"essayer"},null]},{"text":"J'ai rencontré cette fille auparavant.","en":"I've met that girl before.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/70367","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to meet","l":"rencontrer"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"girl"},null]}]}